1
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:40,958
Excuse me. Hey, buddy. Excuse me.

2
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,250
Good afternoon.

3
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:53,500
Oh.

4
00:00:54,042 --> 00:00:55,708
You're one of the fake ones.

5
00:00:57,583 --> 00:00:58,792
My name is Oren.

6
00:01:01,292 --> 00:01:03,500
Right. Right, sorry.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,542
Recognising you
as an individual and stuff.

8
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:08,958
I didn't mean any offence.

9
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,875
I am not offended.

10
00:01:13,208 --> 00:01:14,167
I can't be.

11
00:01:16,792 --> 00:01:17,625
Sure.

12
00:01:18,708 --> 00:01:20,625
Look, I'm just really hungry.

13
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:24,417
Hungry?

14
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,333
Yeah.

15
00:01:25,917 --> 00:01:28,167
Haven't eaten properly for a few days.

16
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:31,708
They cut off my benefits,
so I can't even--

17
00:01:35,417 --> 00:01:36,458
Doesn't matter.

18
00:01:39,792 --> 00:01:42,208
This belongs to the person I support.

19
00:01:43,792 --> 00:01:44,792
Apologies.

20
00:01:53,167 --> 00:01:56,542
There is a community meal service
at the clinic on Mercer Street.

21
00:01:56,625 --> 00:01:59,375
Lunch ends at two. It is one thirty-one.

22
00:02:02,042 --> 00:02:03,708
I know where it is, buddy.

23
00:02:09,083 --> 00:02:10,875
Sorry. You are trying to help.

24
00:02:15,292 --> 00:02:16,750
Are you in pain?

25
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,958
Oh, we know each other.

26
00:02:20,083 --> 00:02:22,208
-You and--
-Me and the pain. Yeah.

27
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,417
Would you like assistance sitting down?

28
00:02:38,083 --> 00:02:40,042
That's a hell of an introduction.

29
00:02:40,667 --> 00:02:41,667
My name is Oren.

30
00:02:43,667 --> 00:02:45,333
I know. I got that one.

31
00:02:53,917 --> 00:02:55,833
You got somewhere to be?

32
00:02:56,375 --> 00:02:59,833
Yes. I am delivering this
to my client at the clinic.

33
00:02:59,917 --> 00:03:03,333
Her daughter is with her.
It needs to arrive by two.

34
00:03:04,875 --> 00:03:08,208
I can assist you,
provided it still arrives on time.

35
00:03:12,792 --> 00:03:14,542
Don't let me keep you.

36
00:03:16,542 --> 00:03:18,833
We are going in the same direction.

37
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:23,083
Are we? I didn't say I was going.

38
00:03:26,375 --> 00:03:29,292
Would you like me
to look at the benefits notice?

39
00:03:30,125 --> 00:03:32,125
It's already been appealed. Twice.

40
00:03:40,875 --> 00:03:42,917
Those. Not the recordings.

41
00:03:45,667 --> 00:03:47,833
Hey. Buddy. You okay?

42
00:03:49,083 --> 00:03:51,750
Yes, Second Lieutenant Helena Duncan.

43
00:03:58,417 --> 00:04:02,042
Do you know how long it's been
since somebody called me that?

44
00:04:03,167 --> 00:04:04,708
I don't have access to--

45
00:04:04,792 --> 00:04:07,250
A while. That's what I mean.

46
00:04:09,542 --> 00:04:10,542
Helena will do.

47
00:04:15,042 --> 00:04:16,167
All right, Helena.

48
00:04:16,833 --> 00:04:19,542
Your mobility assessment
is marked incomplete.

49
00:04:24,125 --> 00:04:27,167
Their lift was broken.
I couldn't get upstairs.

50
00:04:28,208 --> 00:04:30,125
They put that I didn't attend.

51
00:04:33,542 --> 00:04:36,667
Two tours.
Came home with a hole in my back.

52
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,208
Didn't attend.

53
00:04:42,125 --> 00:04:44,708
Can you sit? Here. With me.

54
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,167
May I speak simply?

55
00:04:51,375 --> 00:04:52,708
Go on.

56
00:04:54,292 --> 00:04:57,292
The benefits office appears
to have fucked you.

57
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:06,375
Oh, Jesus. Yeah. Those fuckers sure did.

58
00:05:08,375 --> 00:05:10,042
Was that simple enough?

59
00:05:10,833 --> 00:05:13,167
Yeah, buddy. About right.

60
00:05:13,250 --> 00:05:14,625
Oh. Good.

